# OCC Design Tokens

## Colors

| Role | Value | Usage |
|------|--------|--------|
| Navy (brand dark) | `#1D293D` | Headers, sidebar, primary text |
| Blue (brand accent) | `#1447E6` | CTAs, active states, charts, links |
| Muted text | `text-slate-500` | Labels, subtitles |
| Borders | `border-slate-200` | Cards, dividers |
| Page background | `bg-gray-50` | Via `Layout` wrapper |

Semantic: `emerald` pass/success, `amber` warning, `rose` danger — use sparingly.

## Typography

- Page title: `text-2xl`–`text-3xl font-bold text-[#1D293D]` (or white on navy header)
- Section title: `text-lg font-semibold text-[#1D293D]` — **sentence case**, not all-caps
- KPI number: `text-2xl font-semibold tabular-nums`
- Avoid excessive `uppercase tracking-[0.2em]` on every label; it adds visual noise

## Cards & sections

```jsx
// Section wrapper
<section aria-labelledby="section-id" className="space-y-4">
  <h2 id="section-id" className="text-lg font-semibold text-[#1D293D]">Overview</h2>
  {/* content */}
</section>

// Standard card
<div className="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm" />
```

## Reuse before inventing

- `Layout`, `Sidebar`, `Topbar`, `ChartCard`
- Inertia `Link` for navigation; `router.post` for forms
- Existing page patterns under `Pages/Guidance/` and `Pages/Evaluator/`

## Modals

Overlay: `fixed inset-0 bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center z-50`
